cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the specific software version and commit."
title: "Infrared Thermography and AI for Human Pain: Systematic Review Pipeline"
type: software
version: 1.0.1
date-released: 2026-10-07
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/joaotakotsubo/thermography_ai_pipeline"
url: "https://github.com/joaotakotsubo/thermography_ai_pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Study-specific R workflow for a systematic review of computational models,
  infrared thermography, and human pain. Includes deterministic deduplication,
  reviewer reconciliation, descriptive synthesis, figure generation, input
  contracts, and synthetic tests. Protected source data and completed human
  assessments are not distributed; full numerical reproduction requires them.
